<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">Amalgamation Sub will amalgamate with AARK (the &#8220;<span style="text-decoration:underline">Amalgamation</span>&#8221;), with AARK as the surviving entity and controlled by ATI (by virtue of ATI&#8217;s right to appoint two of ATI&#8217;s independent directors to the three-member AARK board), </p></td></tr></table> </div> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
