<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">the Sole Shareholder will continue to own AARK ordinary shares and ATI&#8217;s equity in the Amalgamation Sub will be converted into an amount of AARK ordinary shares based upon a conversion ratio defined in the Business Combination Agreement (assuming minimum redemptions, ATI and the Sole Shareholder will initially own, prior to any exchange of shares by the Sole Shareholder pursuant to the AARK Exchange Agreement, approximately 39.89% and 60.11% of AARK, respectively), </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
