<td style="width:3%;vertical-align:top" align="left">&#8226;</td>
<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:bold">Proposal No. 6&#8212;The Nasdaq Proposal</span>&#8212;to consider and vote upon a proposal by ordinary resolution to approve, for the purposes of complying with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(a), (b) and (d), the issuance of ATI Class&#160;A ordinary shares and the ATI Class&#160;V ordinary share in connection with the Business Combination and the PIPE Financing. We refer to this proposal as the &#8220;<span style="text-decoration:underline">Nasdaq Proposal</span>.&#8221; </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
