April 1, 2024, ATI may require the owners of AARK and Aeries other than ATI, or the owners of AARK and Aeries other than ATI may elect, to exchange their interests for ATI Class&#160;A ordinary shares or the Cash Exchange Payment, at the option of the party that initiates the exchange. The diagrams below depict the simplified corporate structure of ATI following the Business Combination, both before and after the occurrence of the transactions contemplated in the Exchange Agreements, respectively: </td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="font-size:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align:center">


