<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Assumes 2,710,400 Bonus Shares are issued to the public shareholders. </p></td></tr></table> </div>
