<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top" align="left">(4)</td>
<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Represents interests in AARK or Aeries that are exchangeable for ATI Class&#160;A ordinary shares in connection with the Business Combination, assuming that no party initiating an exchange elects to settle such exchange with a Cash Exchange Payment. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
