<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">The authorized capital stock under the Existing Memorandum and Articles of Association is 500,000,000 Class&#160;A ordinary shares of par value $0.0001 per share, 50,000,000 Class&#160;B ordinary shares of par value $0.0001 per share and 5,000,000 preference shares of par value $0.0001 per share.</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
