<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">As a result of becoming a public company, we will incur increased costs and become subject to additional regulations and requirements, which could lower our profits, make it more difficult to run our business or divert management&#8217;s attention from our business; </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
