<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:bold"><span style="font-style:italic">WWAC Shareholders Receiving a Minority Position in the Combined Company</span></span>. The risk that WWAC shareholders will hold a minority position in the Combined Company; and </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
