<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">pursuant to the Registration Rights Agreement, dated October 21, 2021, between WWAC and Sponsor and certain of WWAC&#8217;s directors and executive officers will have customary registration rights, </p></td></tr></table>
 <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center">117 </p>

