<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">persons that hold Class&#160;A ordinary shares as part of a straddle, constructive sale, hedging, conversion or other integrated or similar transaction; or </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
