<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Assumes that, of the remaining 4,718,054 Public Shares held after redemptions of 18,281,946 Class&#160;A Ordinary shares, 863,214 additional Public Shares (the estimated maximum number of public shares that could be redeemed in connection with the Business Combination, in order to meet the Aggregate Cash requirement, based on a per share redemption price of $10.46 per share) are redeemed in connection with the Business Combination. </p></td></tr></table>
