<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">each person known by WWAC to be the beneficial owner of more than 5% of WWAC&#8217;s outstanding ordinary shares on the record date based on filings with the SEC by such persons; </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
