<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Prior to the Business Combination, the percentage of beneficial ownership of WWAC on the record date is calculated based on (i) 4,718,054 Class&#160;A ordinary shares and (ii) 5,750,000 Class&#160;B ordinary shares, in each case, outstanding as of such date. </p></td></tr></table>
