<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">Figures in the table assume none of the 8,900,000 outstanding private placement warrants or 11,500,000 outstanding public warrants are exercised. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:9pt;border:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
