<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">At a price of $<ix:nonFraction name="wwacu:ClassOfWarrantsRedemptionPricePerUnit" contextRef="PAsOn06_30_2023_SharePriceEqualOrExceedsTenRupeesPerDollarMemberWWACUTriggeringEventAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD_warrant" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.01</ix:nonFraction> per Warrant; </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border:0;width:100%">
