<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">at a price of $<ix:nonFraction name="wwacu:ClassOfWarrantsRedemptionPricePerUnit" contextRef="PAsOn06_30_2023" unitRef="Unit_USD_warrant" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.10</ix:nonFraction> per Warrant, provided that holders will be able to exercise their Warrants on a cashless basis prior to redemption and receive that number of Class&#160;A ordinary shares determined in part by the redemption date and the &#8220;fair market value&#8221; of the Class&#160;A ordinary shares except as otherwise below; </div></td></tr></table><div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border:0;width:100%">
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid">
<td style="width:5%">&#160;</td>
