formation on the vehicle loan see Note 9 &#8211; Long-term debt. </div></div><div style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><div style="font-size: 18pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;;display:inline;">&#160;</div></div>
