<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">means the ordinary shares of AARK, par value SGD1.00 per share.</td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="height:6pt"/>
<td style="height:6pt" colspan="2"/></tr>
