<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">means a clearing house recognised by the laws of the jurisdiction in which the Shares (or depositary receipts therefor) are listed or quoted on a stock exchange or interdealer quotation system in such jurisdiction.</td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="height:6pt"/>
<td style="height:6pt" colspan="2"/></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold">&#8220;Company&#8221;</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">means the above named company.</td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="height:6pt"/>
<td style="height:6pt" colspan="2"/></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold">&#8220;Company&#8217;s Website&#8221;</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">means the website of the Company and/or its <span style="white-space:nowrap">web-address</span> or domain name (if any).</td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="height:6pt"/>
<td style="height:6pt" colspan="2"/></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold">&#8220;Compensation Committee&#8221;</p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top">means the compensation committee of the board of Directors established pursuant to the Articles, or any successor committee.</td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="height:6pt"/>
<td style="height:6pt" colspan="2"/></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
