<td style="width:5%;vertical-align:top" align="left">t.</td>
<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left">&#8220;<span style="font-weight:bold">Employee</span>&#8221; means any officers or employee (as determined in accordance with Code Section&#160;3401(c) and the Treasury Regulations thereunder) of the Company or any Parent or Subsidiary of the Company. </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
