<td align="left" style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:bold"><span style="font-style:italic">Effect of Administrator&#8217;s Decision. </span></span>The Administrator&#8217;s decisions, determinations, and interpretations will be final and binding on all Participants and any other holders of Awards. </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
